{"games":[{"id":120619123349243,"name":"Merge Chiikawa","desc":"💥 Merge Chiikawa together to create rarer ones! 💥\n\nWelcome to Merge Chiikawa! Get ready to:\n\n🧸 Combine cute Chiikawas into bigger and better ones! \n💎 Collect gems to power up faster!\n🎨 Unlock trails and themes to stand out!\n🐾 Get pets that earn you cash while you play!\n🏆 Climb the leaderboards and compete to be in the top!\n\n🎁: Thumb up the game and join the group for a FREE REWARD!\nStart merging and see how many Chiikawas you can find!","path":"/game/120619123349243-merge-chiikawa","slug":"120619123349243-merge-chiikawa","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6f2b73e2effab6b442884efca77b1f846096cff739506f9fec6da8b4d5c39753.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1ac844b43f4532e43c44af2f30c7afd6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":5451497,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-05T08:24:41.160Z","creator":{"name":"Sigma Boy PROD","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13186683160,"name":"McRonalds Tycoon [OG]","desc":"McRonalds back with a different style. Oldskool 2016 tycoon game. Play for the nostalgia vibes.\n\nPlease give the game a thumbs up!\n\nJoin Kuyt Productions","path":"/game/13186683160-mcronalds-tycoon","slug":"13186683160-mcronalds-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d7de55c4f165712209b12e030638c2ac17fc24a4e34cb30f65dcd885f0dbaedf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-80b49081da8883273d4a8cdc0dabc551/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":900883,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-11T17:38:36.221Z","creator":{"name":"iTycoonDeveloper","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":83812712025661,"name":"[Update🚗] Horizon Brazil","desc":"🚗 Horizon Brazil🇧🇷\nWelcome to Horizon Brazil, Roblox's most electrifying open world! 🌆\nExplore Brazil-inspired cities, race on amazing roads, and experience the thrill on four wheels! 🏁\n\nHere, you can customize your car your way - choose the color, the wheels, modify your engine and show off your style on the streets! 😎\nParticipate in races with your friends, discover new places and feel the freedom to drive through a map full of life and adventures. 🌴☀️\n\n💬 Join the community, speed up with the jail and show who's in charge of the asphalt!\nIn Horizon Brazil, every corner is a new story - and the steering wheel is in your hands!\n\n👉 Enter now and live this unique experience! 🇧🇷🔥","path":"/game/83812712025661-horizon-brazil","slug":"83812712025661-horizon-brazil","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/437cc29eb9e2c8a45c178e11b44895bd32b3984a703fb116c8ea330de5d44527.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8a5f77de8dabd0a72bbdac3e678f895a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":3108559,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-23T17:08:40.293Z","creator":{"name":"Comunidade |XP","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15629601567,"name":"strict brother [SHOP]","desc":"You arrive home after a long day, excited to play some video games. You find out your older brother is now in charge of the house. This cant be that bad right..?\n\nDeath is apart of the experience! Learn from your deaths in order to achieve your goal.\n\nPC Controls:\nLShift to Sprint\nC to Tiptoe\nE to Interact\nX for Secondary Interact\nV to Unlock Mouse\nQ to Dodge\n\nXBOX Controls:\nL2 to Sprint\nY to Tiptoe\nX to Interact\nB for Secondary Interact\nY to Dodge\n\nMobile/PC/XBOX Support\n\nInspired by weird strict dad\ntags: strict brother, brother, strict, gaming, hiding, sleeping, horror, sneaking, playing games, weird strict dad, weird strict","path":"/game/15629601567-strict-brother","slug":"15629601567-strict-brother","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d6014e316f4cdd0bee1c885d5dede6ce1f98080fb70698417524d2c8d3f0bf9e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-be9945b53d01f677462d440ab1c2fda8/150/150